Error [E0003]: Expected a statement, found `do`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_for.jet:9:5
    |
  9 |     do {
    |     ^^
 Why: Jet uses one body-first loop form; put the stop test inside the body and exit with `break`
 Fix: Write `loop { … if test { break } }`; for repeated input, use `loop line in io.stdin().lines()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
